From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 04:28:50 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 155/202] Meridian: Boosts

Arc's Boosts: a site the person's way, from the site controls.
- Colours (a hue turn), a font, Zap (click what to hide, Esc to stop), and
  their own CSS and JavaScript, on every page of the site; on/off, delete.
- Improve with Claude (or the AI picked in Settings > AI): the page's outline
  and the person's wish go to the AI, its CSS becomes the boost; Undo.
- Agents: get_boost / set_boost over MCP (JavaScript only when agents may run
  it).
- Arc's boosts (unpacked extensions in Arc's "boosts" folder) come over with
  the rest of Arc's data.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
